@KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5183

### Lista todas as crianças
GET {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/children
Accept: application/json

### Cria uma criança
POST {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas",
  "age": 8,
  "monthlyGoalPoints": 200
}

### Consulta criança por ID
GET {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/children/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Atualiza a meta mensal da criança
PUT {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/children/{id}/goal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monthlyGoalPoints": 250,
  "monthlyGoalRewardId": null
}

### Cria uma atividade para a criança
POST {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "childId": "{childId}",
  "title": "Arrumar a cama",
  "description": "Deixar o quarto organizado",
  "points": 15
}

### Lista atividades da criança
GET {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/child/{childId}
Accept: application/json

### Conclui uma atividade
PATCH {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/{activityId}/complete

### Cria uma recompensa
POST {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rewards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "30 min de Video Game",
  "requiredPoints": 50
}

### Lista recompensas ativas
GET {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rewards
Accept: application/json

### Resgata uma recompensa
POST {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rewards/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "childId": "{childId}",
  "rewardId": "{rewardId}"
}

### Ativa/desativa uma recompensa
PATCH {{KidsRewards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rewards/{rewardId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}